selftext:
I'm 19 yo, male, 170 cm, 65 kg, Chinese-Indonesian.

&amp;#x200B;

So when I was younger, I had noticed that I sweat a lot, if I ran for like 30 secs I'd sweat and wet my back. When I was 12 I already had hair leg all around, I probably had the most hair leg compared to anyone in my class, also when I cut my hair (hair hair), it'd regrow just at the same height in 2-3 months, IDK if this is normal or not, but I usually get a relatively short haircut, I find it annoying to have my hair reaching my ear already.

&amp;#x200B;

Also this, I don't know if this is related to the prior problems I mentioned but sometimes when I scratch my head, I get an abundant amount of dandruff all over my pillow, I'm telling you, that's some serious amount of dandruff. Sometimes I can swipe them, gather them together and there this big pile of dandruff like some powder. 

Also I have so much dead skin face when I wipe them after I take a bath.

&amp;#x200B;

I don't know what to do to treat them and I'm disgusted with myself too.

I take a bath twice a day and do shampoo every 2-4 days.

question_text:
